}
\arguments{
\item{object}{A fitted kdrcc object.}
}
\details{
The kernel basis diagnostics report the within-set root mean square for each candidate feature and its retention status. The covariance status records whether the final fit supports standard errors, intervals and hypothesis tests.
}
